<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>痿症 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%97%BF%E7%97%87/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 08:28:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%97%BF%E7%97%87/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>长治法：论痿症 论腰痛 论背脊骨痛 论两腿酸痛 论努肉扳睛 论痉病</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-14-changzhifa/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 08:26:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/3-14-changzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%89%E5%B0%84%E9%9B%86/">卷三射集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“长治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;痿症、痉病、腰痛、背脊骨痛、两腿酸痛、胬肉扳睛&lt;/strong&gt;等经年累月、难以速愈的慢性病证治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;永远之症，不可以岁月计也。必多服久服，缓缓培补，或祛邪于潜移默化之中，方能收功&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>大治法：论痿症 论肾虚如白虎汤症 论汗出如雨不止 论直中阴经 论治阳明之火</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-9-dazhifa/</link><pubDate>Thu, 23 Apr 2026 09:25:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/1-9-dazhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%B8%80%E7%A4%BC%E9%9B%86/">卷一礼集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“大治法”部分，论述对于&lt;strong&gt;气血大亏、火盛阳亡、阴寒直中&lt;/strong&gt;等急重虚证，必须&lt;strong&gt;大剂用药，重剂补托或攻补兼施&lt;/strong&gt;，否则杯水车薪，反促其危。内容涵盖痿症、肾虚似白虎汤症、大汗亡阳、直中阴经及阳明火盛诸证。</description></item></channel></rss>